2120
00:02:43,187 --> 00:02:44,607
Vince...

2121
00:02:45,187 --> 00:02:48,857
Is that scary lady going to come with us?

2122
00:02:48,857 --> 00:02:49,987
Who knows...

2123
00:02:50,447 --> 00:02:52,237
Would you be happy if she does, Vince?

2124
00:02:55,027 --> 00:02:56,867
You're making a funny face, Vince.

2125
00:02:59,747 --> 00:03:00,827
But...

2126
00:03:02,497 --> 00:03:04,207
You know, don't you?

2127
00:03:04,787 --> 00:03:06,297
You know that creature...

2128
00:03:06,297 --> 00:03:07,627
You know PROXY.

2129
00:03:08,257 --> 00:03:11,047
Why does it appear only when I'm around you?

2130
00:03:11,717 --> 00:03:14,047
How do you summon PROXY to you?

2131
00:03:14,047 --> 00:03:15,557
What are you?

2132
00:03:16,887 --> 00:03:19,727
I didn't know... for the longest time...

2133
00:03:21,097 --> 00:03:23,727
that I was a PROXY.

2134
00:03:24,767 --> 00:03:25,477
What are you-

2135
00:03:25,477 --> 00:03:27,687
I'm not summoning it to me!

2136
00:03:31,947 --> 00:03:34,367
I am PROXY.

2137
00:03:40,707 --> 00:03:43,917
She should go back to Romdeau.

2138
00:03:45,077 --> 00:03:49,007
meditation  when you're smiling

2139
00:03:45,077 --> 00:03:49,007
meditation  when you're smiling

2140
00:04:02,517 --> 00:04:06,557
We've managed to catch up with the ship
 without using the fuel we need to go back.

2141
00:04:40,807 --> 00:04:43,517
Hey! Scary lady!

2142
00:04:43,517 --> 00:04:45,097
This way, over here!

2143
00:04:45,097 --> 00:04:46,187
Hey!

2144
00:04:54,567 --> 00:04:57,317
That autoreiv's infected with cogito.

2145
00:04:57,817 --> 00:04:59,487
Iggy, wait in here.

2146
00:05:00,197 --> 00:05:01,577
But, Re-l!

2147
00:05:20,507 --> 00:05:21,677
What?

2148
00:05:21,677 --> 00:05:25,227
Um, I can't eat,

2149
00:05:25,227 --> 00:05:28,347
but I think it's so neat when I watch other people eat.

2150
00:05:28,347 --> 00:05:30,057
You make it hard for me to eat.

2151
00:05:30,057 --> 00:05:31,517
Get lost.

2152
00:05:34,437 --> 00:05:36,237
I'm sorry, Miss Re-l.

2153
00:05:37,407 --> 00:05:39,117
I won't believe it.

2154
00:05:39,987 --> 00:05:42,157
I won't believe that you're PROXY.

2155
00:05:43,737 --> 00:05:45,657
You might be right.

2156
00:05:46,207 --> 00:05:49,207
I know far less than what I don't know.

2157
00:05:50,417 --> 00:05:53,497
But... that's why I want to know.

2158
00:05:54,047 --> 00:05:59,587
Including myself, there are several
 PROXIES remaining somewhere in this world.

2159
00:05:59,587 --> 00:06:00,757
Several?

2160
00:06:01,177 --> 00:06:02,467
How do you know for sure?

2161
00:06:07,807 --> 00:06:10,147
Because I feel it hasn't ended yet.

2162
00:06:12,357 --> 00:06:18,147
I have probably met two other PROXIES... and killed them.

2163
00:06:18,147 --> 00:06:19,357
What?

2164
00:06:19,357 --> 00:06:21,447
The first time, it was in Haros;

2165
00:06:21,447 --> 00:06:23,077
the second time, it was in Asura.

2166
00:06:23,827 --> 00:06:26,497
The PROXY I met the second time said...

2167
00:06:27,117 --> 00:06:29,617
that I have lost my memories.

2168
00:06:30,367 --> 00:06:33,247
My homeland, Mosk,

2169
00:06:33,787 --> 00:06:36,207
is directly involved in the loss of my memories.

2170
00:06:36,917 --> 00:06:40,127
If I go there, I should find something.

2171
00:06:41,177 --> 00:06:44,097
Now that I know I'm a PROXY,

2172
00:06:44,637 --> 00:06:46,637
I can't go back.

2173
00:06:46,637 --> 00:06:47,887
I see.

2174
00:06:48,847 --> 00:06:51,937
But you can't believe it, can you?

2175
00:06:54,017 --> 00:06:54,977
No.

2176
00:07:26,387 --> 00:07:28,177
Kill PROXY?

2177
00:07:28,677 --> 00:07:33,017
This is all that I can do for you right now.

2178
00:07:33,557 --> 00:07:37,397
This is the only way to kill the immortal PROXY.

2179
00:07:38,727 --> 00:07:41,317
These bullets are equipped with FP rays.

2180
00:07:42,407 --> 00:07:44,367
It's harmless to the human body,

2181
00:07:44,367 --> 00:07:47,367
but it affects the amrita cells only PROXY has.

2182
00:07:47,867 --> 00:07:49,947
No matter where it hits,

2183
00:07:49,947 --> 00:07:52,577
the FP rays will destroy the cells

2184
00:07:52,577 --> 00:07:54,627
and the PROXY should die - in theory.

2185
00:07:55,327 --> 00:07:57,167
I can't believe it.

2186
00:07:57,167 --> 00:07:58,837
Kill that monster...

2187
00:07:59,297 --> 00:08:01,877
However, this is only in theory.

2188
00:08:02,427 --> 00:08:03,837
So I'm entrusting these to you.

2189
00:08:05,137 --> 00:08:08,057
If you encounter PROXY by any chance...

2190
00:08:08,717 --> 00:08:10,847
Collect experimental data.

2191
00:08:11,637 --> 00:08:13,187
But Daedalus,

2192
00:08:13,637 --> 00:08:17,107
my primary objective is to capture PROXY.

2193
00:08:17,687 --> 00:08:19,397
It's my objective as well, of course.

2194
00:08:21,027 --> 00:08:22,817
I'll be waiting, Re-l.

2195
00:08:25,737 --> 00:08:27,737
<i>Both Daedalus and I thought</i>

2196
00:08:27,737 --> 00:08:32,707
<i>that all the mysteries would be solved once we'd captured PROXY.</i>

2197
00:08:35,537 --> 00:08:36,827
<i>But is that true?</i>

2198
00:08:38,207 --> 00:08:41,087
<i>The lawless world I've been witness to...</i>

2199
00:08:42,507 --> 00:08:43,717
<i>What's anomalous</i>

2200
00:08:44,007 --> 00:08:47,717
<i>is that Romdeau alone can maintain order in such a world.</i>

2201
00:08:48,547 --> 00:08:49,467
<i>No...</i>

2202
00:08:50,057 --> 00:08:52,137
<i>Romdeau's crumbling as well.</i>

2203
00:08:52,767 --> 00:08:55,557
<i>The comatose PROXY went berserk and died.</i>

2204
00:08:56,647 --> 00:08:58,607
<i>The cogito virus is spreading.</i>

2205
00:09:00,067 --> 00:09:01,977
<i>There was a murder attempt on me,</i>

2206
00:09:01,977 --> 00:09:04,147
<i>the Representative's granddaughter.</i>

2207
00:09:06,157 --> 00:09:08,447
<i>Even if that man is PROXY,</i>

2208
00:09:08,987 --> 00:09:12,577
<i>just what could be gained by taking him back to Romdeau now?</i>

2209
00:09:14,867 --> 00:09:17,327
<i>I can't go on any further, either.</i>

2210
00:09:18,497 --> 00:09:19,917
What should I do?

2211
00:09:20,377 --> 00:09:21,087
Re-l,

2212
00:09:22,167 --> 00:09:24,257
are you going to apprehend Vincent Law?

2213
00:09:25,297 --> 00:09:30,427
Either way, we have to go back to
 Romdeau now, or we won't be able to at all.

2214
00:09:30,887 --> 00:09:32,347
You know that, right?

2215
00:09:32,347 --> 00:09:34,057
I don't believe it.

2216
00:09:34,057 --> 00:09:34,847
What?

2217
00:09:35,177 --> 00:09:36,347
But I must confirm it.

2218
00:09:37,137 --> 00:09:38,347
Re-l!

2219
00:09:45,897 --> 00:09:47,987
This man is PROXY...

2220
00:09:48,567 --> 00:09:50,067
If I shoot him, I can know for sure.

2221
00:09:50,067 --> 00:09:51,827
If he doesn't die, it's a lie.

2222
00:09:53,407 --> 00:09:55,497
But... if it's true...

2223
00:09:55,497 --> 00:09:57,207
No, impossible.

2224
00:09:58,417 --> 00:10:00,667
The FP bullet is harmless to humans.

2225
00:10:01,747 --> 00:10:03,497
I can just go for the legs.

2226
00:10:12,177 --> 00:10:13,677
Vincent Law...

2227
00:10:14,517 --> 00:10:18,187
I don't believe that you and PROXY are entirely unrelated.

2228
00:10:18,727 --> 00:10:23,397
That's why I came after you this far.

2229
00:10:24,857 --> 00:10:29,407
That might mean that I was drawn to you.

2230
00:10:30,697 --> 00:10:34,077
During my journey, I thought about you several times.

2231
00:10:35,697 --> 00:10:37,827
Are you PROXY?

2232
00:10:39,077 --> 00:10:41,457
Even so, I still must...

2233
00:10:51,137 --> 00:10:52,597
I love you.

2234
00:10:53,887 --> 00:10:54,677
What?

2235
00:10:54,677 --> 00:10:55,807
I love you.

2236
00:10:55,807 --> 00:10:57,387
I love you, Miss Re-l.

2237
00:11:10,357 --> 00:11:11,567
But...

2238
00:11:12,817 --> 00:11:14,617
That an immigrant like me...

2239
00:11:15,157 --> 00:11:16,327
No, that's not it.

2240
00:11:16,327 --> 00:11:18,037
That a monster like me...

2241
00:11:18,867 --> 00:11:20,917
would think of you like that...

2242
00:11:21,497 --> 00:11:23,417
I thought I would never see you again.

2243
00:11:23,787 --> 00:11:25,877
I tried to let go many times.

2244
00:11:26,457 --> 00:11:29,547
But I still can't help loving you.

2245
00:12:01,957 --> 00:12:03,117
Who are you?!

2246
00:12:06,457 --> 00:12:07,667
Wait!

2247
00:12:21,727 --> 00:12:23,557
There are people here too?

2248
00:12:48,627 --> 00:12:49,627
How is it?

2249
00:12:49,627 --> 00:12:51,127
No good.

2250
00:12:52,007 --> 00:12:55,627
Even if we allow for the possibility that we can refuel somewhere,

2251
00:12:55,627 --> 00:12:58,047
it's too dangerous to go any farther.

2252
00:12:58,847 --> 00:13:00,887
The prince said it as well, didn't he?

2253
00:13:00,887 --> 00:13:02,927
That once we had only enough fuel for the return trip,

2254
00:13:02,927 --> 00:13:06,267
we were to return and report.

2255
00:13:07,147 --> 00:13:10,647
You have to consider the prince's concern for you.

2256
00:13:11,277 --> 00:13:13,527
Your cute boyfriend's feelings, that is.

2257
00:13:13,527 --> 00:13:15,647
Daedalus is my primary care physician.

2258
00:13:15,987 --> 00:13:19,277
In any case, let's return to Romdeau for now,

2259
00:13:19,577 --> 00:13:20,527
Re-l.

2260
00:13:20,527 --> 00:13:24,247
You're quite happy-go-lucky, aren't you, Iggy.

2261
00:13:24,707 --> 00:13:27,877
In Romdeau, Re-l Mayer is dead.

2262
00:13:28,247 --> 00:13:31,707
The prince will do something about that too.

2263
00:13:31,707 --> 00:13:34,167
My pride doesn't permit that.

2264
00:13:34,167 --> 00:13:36,677
If I go back now, it means I wasted my time.

2265
00:13:36,677 --> 00:13:37,927
But...

2266
00:13:38,797 --> 00:13:40,007
I know!

2267
00:13:40,007 --> 00:13:43,177
If our ship can't make the trip, we have that man's ship!

2268
00:13:43,887 --> 00:13:46,387
That ship moves by wind power.

2269
00:13:46,387 --> 00:13:49,307
It doesn't look sophisticated, but
 we won't need to worry about fuel.

2270
00:13:49,897 --> 00:13:51,767
You're saying we should seize their ship?

2271
00:13:51,767 --> 00:13:52,937
Maybe.

2272
00:13:53,357 --> 00:13:55,607
Do you want to stay with that guy so much?

2273
00:13:55,607 --> 00:13:56,857
I wonder.

2274
00:13:57,487 --> 00:13:59,947
He seems to want me to, at least.

2275
00:14:00,237 --> 00:14:00,987
Huh?

2276
00:14:00,987 --> 00:14:03,037
He has feelings for me.

2277
00:14:03,447 --> 00:14:04,617
Besides,

2278
00:14:05,117 --> 00:14:07,407
I don't want to go back to Romdeau yet.

2279
00:14:07,407 --> 00:14:08,457
Re-l...

2280
00:14:08,457 --> 00:14:09,787
Are you finished yet?

2281
00:14:09,787 --> 00:14:11,877
Oh, yeah I'm done.

2282
00:14:12,537 --> 00:14:13,997
I'm going to resolve this.

2283
00:14:13,997 --> 00:14:15,297
Definitely.

2284
00:14:20,467 --> 00:14:22,347
Hey, Pino.

2285
00:14:24,137 --> 00:14:25,637
Gone...

2286
00:14:26,927 --> 00:14:28,017
Jeez.

2287
00:14:28,017 --> 00:14:31,767
I wish she'd learn a few things from Miss Re-l's Entourage.

2288
00:15:31,327 --> 00:15:33,827
You came to the rabbit yesterday, didn't you?

2289
00:15:34,287 --> 00:15:37,457
Since the rabbit broke down, Vince's been going, "Bang, bang"!

2290
00:15:37,457 --> 00:15:40,167
I ran away because of the all the noise.

2291
00:15:41,427 --> 00:15:43,967
Hey, why are you so quiet?

2292
00:15:45,257 --> 00:15:47,637
You don't want to talk with me?

2293
00:15:48,717 --> 00:15:51,187
You can't speak?

2294
00:15:56,517 --> 00:15:57,767
Vince...

2295
00:16:17,707 --> 00:16:18,747
What's going on?

2296
00:16:20,257 --> 00:16:21,297
Don't.

2297
00:16:21,917 --> 00:16:24,337
That autoreiv is infected.

2298
00:16:24,337 --> 00:16:25,927
Stay here.

2299
00:16:27,547 --> 00:16:29,467
It's too late to worry about that.

2300
00:16:52,037 --> 00:16:53,707
Vincent Law...

2301
00:16:57,457 --> 00:16:59,287
Lady!

2302
00:17:21,277 --> 00:17:23,607
Vincent... you...

2303
00:17:33,657 --> 00:17:34,827
Vince!

2304
00:17:55,517 --> 00:17:56,637
Vincen-

2305
00:17:57,187 --> 00:17:58,597
I'm sure he'll be fine.

2306
00:17:59,057 --> 00:18:00,727
Vince is strong!

2307
00:18:02,357 --> 00:18:03,977
Re-l!

2308
00:18:05,437 --> 00:18:06,397
Iggy...

2309
00:18:06,897 --> 00:18:08,197
Where are you going?

2310
00:18:08,197 --> 00:18:09,487
It's dangerous.

2311
00:18:10,907 --> 00:18:12,737
Lady!

2312
00:18:14,447 --> 00:18:15,367
Re-l!

2313
00:18:15,657 --> 00:18:16,497
Vincent has...

2314
00:18:16,497 --> 00:18:18,287
Yes, I saw him too.

2315
00:18:18,707 --> 00:18:21,707
That was the PROXY I saw in Romdeau.

2316
00:18:22,377 --> 00:18:26,087
The first one that ever terrified me...

2317
00:18:27,087 --> 00:18:28,087
But...

2318
00:18:30,177 --> 00:18:33,467
I must confirm the effectiveness of FP bullets:

2319
00:18:33,467 --> 00:18:36,727
whether they can actually kill a PROXY.

2320
00:18:38,437 --> 00:18:40,147
So you're going to shoot him then, Re-l.

2321
00:19:11,467 --> 00:19:12,927
Stay calm.

2322
00:19:13,467 --> 00:19:15,557
We have only two FP bullets.

2323
00:19:15,557 --> 00:19:16,517
Right.

2324
00:19:17,267 --> 00:19:19,477
You weren't wrong.

2325
00:19:19,977 --> 00:19:21,767
The man we've been after all this time...

2326
00:19:21,767 --> 00:19:23,017
is the PROXY.

2327
00:19:24,187 --> 00:19:26,647
We can go back to Romdeau now.

2328
00:20:23,957 --> 00:20:25,667
Why'd you shoot that one?

2329
00:20:31,967 --> 00:20:33,007
Iggy.

2330
00:20:36,887 --> 00:20:38,927
Vital signs: negative.

2331
00:20:39,467 --> 00:20:41,557
I see. So it's dead.

2332
00:20:43,307 --> 00:20:44,597
Miss Re-l...

2333
00:21:06,537 --> 00:21:08,287
I saw it with my own eyes.

2334
00:21:08,837 --> 00:21:10,837
You are indeed a PROXY.

2335
00:21:11,507 --> 00:21:15,587
And this gun is the only weapon capable of killing a PROXY.

2336
00:21:16,547 --> 00:21:20,717
Vincent, I can kill you by pulling this trigger.

2337
00:21:22,557 --> 00:21:23,977
Kill me?

2338
00:21:25,387 --> 00:21:27,597
Did you say that you'd kill me?

2339
00:21:28,557 --> 00:21:29,937
Kill <i>me</i>?

2340
00:21:29,937 --> 00:21:31,187
Stop it!

2341
00:21:38,277 --> 00:21:40,487
Miss... Re-l...

2342
00:21:42,077 --> 00:21:43,947
But I won't kill you for now.

2343
00:21:43,947 --> 00:21:45,497
I'll go with you.

2344
00:21:45,497 --> 00:21:46,407
Re-l...

2345
00:21:46,867 --> 00:21:49,127
What I want is the truth!

2346
00:21:49,577 --> 00:21:51,287
Not a PROXY's death.

2347
00:21:54,257 --> 00:21:56,047
But this bullet...

2348
00:21:56,047 --> 00:21:58,177
I'll unleash it on you someday.

2349
00:21:58,467 --> 00:22:00,757
Can you still say that you love me?

2350
00:22:14,687 --> 00:22:16,317
It's still quite impressive.

2351
00:22:16,777 --> 00:22:18,567
I'm sure Daedalus will be happy.

2352
00:22:19,107 --> 00:22:21,987
I can't go back to Romdeau by myself.

2353
00:22:21,987 --> 00:22:25,827
Tell Daedalus everything you saw here.

2354
00:22:26,327 --> 00:22:28,417
No. I can't accept that order.

2355
00:22:28,867 --> 00:22:31,457
You should go back to Romdeau as well.

2356
00:22:31,457 --> 00:22:34,337
Since that man is a PROXY, it's all the more reason to.

2357
00:22:34,627 --> 00:22:36,007
It's too dangerous.

2358
00:22:36,007 --> 00:22:36,967
Why?

2359
00:22:37,547 --> 00:22:39,217
You wouldn't understand.

2360
00:22:39,837 --> 00:22:41,137
"Why"?

2361
00:22:41,597 --> 00:22:43,217
If I don't know why myself,

2362
00:22:44,427 --> 00:22:47,057
how can you, an autoreiv, know why?

2363
00:22:47,637 --> 00:22:49,557
Re-l, I-

2364
00:22:49,557 --> 00:22:50,597
Application off.

2365
00:22:51,307 --> 00:22:53,057
Obey me, Iggy.

2366
00:22:53,897 --> 00:22:55,567
Go back to Romdeau.

2367
00:23:04,157 --> 00:23:05,077
Understood.

2368
00:23:05,787 --> 00:23:07,577
I will return to Romdeau.

2369
00:23:07,577 --> 00:23:09,157
Confirmation requested.

2370
00:23:09,157 --> 00:23:10,077
Confirmed.

2371
00:23:31,897 --> 00:23:33,607
What's going to happen?

2372
00:23:35,357 --> 00:23:36,567
What's going to happen...

2373
00:23:37,027 --> 00:23:38,227
from now on?

